OL,6,
OL,7,FJurors in the trial of Lindsay Clancy,
OL,8,Faccused of murdering her three
OL,9,Fchildren, tell the judge they are
OL,10,Fdeadlocked, unable to come to a
OL,11,Funanimous verdict
OL,13,FThe judge has ordered them to keep
OL,14,Fdeliberating
OL,16,FClancy is on trial for killing her
OL,17,Fthree small children in the basement of
OL,18,Ftheir family home in Massachusetts in
OL,19,F2023
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
